<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant flex-grow font-normal">Equipamiento de última generación integrado con sistemas de registro electrónico.</p>
</div>
<!-- Card 4 -->
<div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-secondary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">medical_services</span>
</div>
